{"unit_id":"mmparko__dsh-purge#feature-1","repo":"mmparko/dsh-purge","commit":"033e6bd1e0f101352b39075ecd0d758ffef26b76","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-purge 的功能「提示词与规则注入」：插件把解析出的提示词或规则内容注册为 DSH systemPrompt 段，并提供规则管理模块。启用插件后由会话提示词组装触发。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:379-390","lib/rules.js:1-50"]}
{"unit_id":"mmparko__dsh-purge#feature-2","repo":"mmparko/dsh-purge","commit":"033e6bd1e0f101352b39075ecd0d758ffef26b76","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-purge 的功能「补丁管理」：CLI 可查看状态、应用、回滚或卸载补丁；用户可用 --status、--apply、--revert 或 --uninstall 操作。","source":"generated","evidence":["bin/dsh-purge.js:38-46","bin/dsh-purge.js:98-115"]}
